{
  "format": "xuexi-authored@1",
  "lessonId": "en-g2a.u2.i-am-you-are.lecture",
  "title": "我是丹尼，你很高！",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "type": "slide",
      "title": "情境导入",
      "blocks": [
        { "id": "h1", "kind": "heading", "text": "新同学见面啦" },
        { "id": "t1", "kind": "text", "text": "怎样介绍自己？怎样说说对方？" },
        {
          "id": "c1",
          "kind": "cards",
          "items": [
            { "id": "c1a", "text": "Danny 丹尼", "color": "blue" },
            { "id": "c1b", "text": "Mary 玛丽", "color": "orange" }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "script": [
        { "say": "小朋友们好！开学第一天，丹尼遇到了新同学玛丽。" },
        { "say": "他们要互相认识一下。我们先复习上节课的单词，跟我读。" },
        { "say": "boy, girl, big, small", "lang": "en" },
        { "spotlight": "t1" },
        { "say": "今天我们学习怎样介绍自己，还有怎样说一说对方。" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "slide",
      "title": "句型：I'm ...",
      "blocks": [
        { "id": "h1", "kind": "heading", "text": "介绍自己：我是……" },
        {
          "id": "c1",
          "kind": "cards",
          "items": [
            { "id": "c1a", "text": "I'm Danny.", "color": "blue" },
            { "id": "c1b", "text": "I'm Mary.", "color": "orange" }
          ]
        },
        { "id": "t1", "kind": "text", "text": "I'm = I am，说的是“我”" }
      ],
      "script": [
        { "say": "介绍自己的时候，先说“我是”，再说自己的名字。跟我读。" },
        { "laser": "c1a" },
        { "say": "I'm Danny. I'm Danny.", "lang": "en" },
        { "laser": "c1b" },
        { "say": "I'm Mary. I'm Mary.", "lang": "en" },
        { "spotlight": "t1" },
        { "say": "这个词我们上一单元见过，意思是“我是”。说它的时候，用手指一指自己。" },
        { "say": "你也来试一试，指着自己，说出你的名字吧！" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "slide",
      "title": "句型：You're ...",
      "blocks": [
        { "id": "h1", "kind": "heading", "text": "说说对方：你是……" },
        {
          "id": "c1",
          "kind": "cards",
          "items": [
            { "id": "c1a", "text": "tall 高的", "color": "green" },
            { "id": "c1b", "text": "short 矮的", "color": "purple" }
          ]
        },
        { "id": "t1", "kind": "text", "text": "You're tall.  你很高。" },
        { "id": "t2", "kind": "text", "text": "You're = You are，说的是“你”" }
      ],
      "script": [
        { "say": "玛丽个子高高的。高的，跟我读，踮起脚尖。" },
        { "laser": "c1a" },
        { "say": "tall, tall", "lang": "en" },
        { "say": "丹尼个子矮矮的。矮的，跟我读，弯弯膝盖。" },
        { "laser": "c1b" },
        { "say": "short, short", "lang": "en" },
        { "spotlight": "t1" },
        { "say": "想说对方的样子，就用“你是”，说的时候指一指对方。跟我读。" },
        { "say": "You're tall. You're tall.", "lang": "en" },
        { "spotlight": "t2" },
        { "say": "这个词也是两个词缩在一起的，中间有一个小撇，意思是“你是”。" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "slide",
      "title": "情景对话",
      "blocks": [
        { "id": "h1", "kind": "heading", "text": "I'm Danny" },
        {
          "id": "g1",
          "kind": "table",
          "rows": [
            ["Danny:", "Hello, I'm Danny."],
            ["Mary:", "Hi, Danny. I'm Mary."],
            ["Danny:", "Oh, you're tall. I'm short."]
          ]
        }
      ],
      "script": [
        { "say": "我们来读课文里的对话。丹尼先介绍自己。" },
        { "spotlight": "g1" },
        { "say": "Hello, I'm Danny.", "lang": "en" },
        { "say": "玛丽回答，也介绍了自己。" },
        { "say": "Hi, Danny. I'm Mary.", "lang": "en" },
        { "say": "丹尼抬头一看，玛丽比他高，他说。" },
        { "say": "Oh, you're tall. I'm short.", "lang": "en" },
        { "say": "我们分角色再读一遍。你来当丹尼，先说。" },
        { "say": "Hello, I'm Danny.", "lang": "en" },
        { "say": "老师当玛丽。" },
        { "say": "Hi, Danny. I'm Mary.", "lang": "en" },
        { "say": "丹尼最后说什么？对，你很高，我很矮。" },
        { "say": "Oh, you're tall. I'm short.", "lang": "en" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "slide",
      "title": "替换练习",
      "blocks": [
        { "id": "h1", "kind": "heading", "text": "换一换，说一说" },
        {
          "id": "g1",
          "kind": "table",
          "rows": [
            ["说自己", "说对方"],
            ["I'm a boy.", "You're a girl."],
            ["I'm small.", "You're big."],
            ["I'm short.", "You're tall."]
          ]
        }
      ],
      "script": [
        { "say": "把学过的单词放进句子里。左边说自己，右边说对方。跟我读。" },
        { "spotlight": "g1" },
        { "say": "I'm a boy. You're a girl.", "lang": "en" },
        { "say": "说男孩、女孩的时候，别忘了前面的小词。" },
        { "say": "I'm small. You're big.", "lang": "en" },
        { "say": "说大小、高矮的时候，前面不用加。" },
        { "say": "I'm short. You're tall.", "lang": "en" },
        { "say": "说自己时指自己，说对方时指对方，你做对了吗？" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "slide",
      "title": "书写小提示",
      "blocks": [
        { "id": "h1", "kind": "heading", "text": "书写小提示" },
        {
          "id": "l1",
          "kind": "bullets",
          "items": ["I'm、You're 中间有一撇", "句子开头字母大写", "名字开头字母大写"]
        }
      ],
      "script": [
        { "say": "写这些句子的时候，要注意三件事。" },
        { "spotlight": "l1" },
        { "say": "第一，“我是”和“你是”这两个词，中间都有一个小撇，写的时候别漏掉。" },
        { "say": "第二，每个句子开头的第一个字母要大写。" },
        { "say": "第三，丹尼、玛丽这样的名字，第一个字母也要大写。一起读。" },
        { "say": "Hi, Danny. I'm Mary.", "lang": "en" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "slide",
      "title": "学法口诀",
      "blocks": [
        { "id": "h1", "kind": "heading", "text": "指一指，说一说" },
        {
          "id": "l1",
          "kind": "bullets",
          "items": ["说我自己指自己", "说你对方指对方"]
        },
        { "id": "t1", "kind": "text", "text": "I'm Danny.   You're Mary." }
      ],
      "script": [
        { "say": "我们学一个口诀，老师读一句，你跟一句。" },
        { "spotlight": "l1" },
        { "say": "说我自己指自己——" },
        { "say": "I'm Danny.", "lang": "en" },
        { "say": "说你对方指对方——" },
        { "say": "You're Mary.", "lang": "en" },
        { "say": "手指指对了，句子就不会用错啦！" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "slide",
      "title": "小结",
      "blocks": [
        { "id": "h1", "kind": "heading", "text": "今天学会了" },
        { "id": "t1", "kind": "text", "text": "I'm ...  我是……" },
        { "id": "t2", "kind": "text", "text": "You're ...  你是……" }
      ],
      "script": [
        { "say": "一句话小结：介绍自己用“我是”，说说对方用“你是”。一起读。" },
        { "say": "I'm Danny. You're Mary.", "lang": "en" },
        { "say": "下次认识新朋友，就用英语介绍一下自己吧！" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "quiz",
      "title": "判断题",
      "intro": "下面我们做几道判断题，想一想说得对不对。",
      "questions": [
        {
          "question": "丹尼介绍自己时说：“You're Danny.”",
          "options": ["对", "错"],
          "answer": [1],
          "analysis": "介绍自己要说 I'm Danny.；You're 是说对方的。"
        },
        {
          "question": "tall 的意思是“高的”。",
          "options": ["对", "错"],
          "answer": [0],
          "analysis": "tall 是高的，short 是矮的。"
        },
        {
          "question": "“You're a girl.”的意思是“你是一个女孩。”",
          "options": ["对", "错"],
          "answer": [0],
          "analysis": "You're 是“你是”，a girl 是“一个女孩”。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "quiz",
      "title": "选择题",
      "intro": "接下来是选择题，选出正确的答案。",
      "questions": [
        {
          "question": "你想告诉别人“我是玛丽。”，应该说：",
          "options": ["You're Mary.", "I'm Mary.", "Hi, Mary."],
          "answer": [1],
          "analysis": "介绍自己用 I'm：I'm Mary."
        },
        {
          "question": "看到对方个子很高，你说：",
          "options": ["You're tall.", "I'm tall.", "You're short."],
          "answer": [0],
          "analysis": "说对方用 You're，高的是 tall：You're tall."
        },
        {
          "question": "下面哪一句书写正确？",
          "options": ["im Danny.", "I'm danny.", "I'm Danny."],
          "answer": [2],
          "analysis": "I 要大写，中间有撇号，名字 Danny 开头也要大写。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "quiz",
      "title": "填空与情景交际",
      "intro": "最后是填空和情景交际，选出最合适的一项。",
      "questions": [
        {
          "question": "Danny: Hello, I'm Danny.  Mary: （　）",
          "options": ["Hi, Danny. I'm Mary.", "Hi, Danny. You're Mary.", "Good night, Danny."],
          "answer": [0],
          "analysis": "玛丽要介绍自己，用 I'm Mary."
        },
        {
          "question": "You're （　） girl.",
          "options": ["a", "tall", "big"],
          "answer": [0],
          "analysis": "说“一个女孩”要加 a：You're a girl."
        },
        {
          "question": "Oh, you're tall. I'm （　）.",
          "options": ["short", "boy", "girl"],
          "answer": [0],
          "analysis": "你很高，我很矮，高和矮意思相反，所以填 short：I'm short."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
